cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this software when using our reproducibility package. It supports the paper
  Trustworthy Agentic O-RAN Security: From Threat Detection to Safe Action,
  Governance, and Standardization, which is under review. The accepted-paper
  citation will be added after acceptance. This software citation is separate
  from the paper's author list and does not imply that the paper is accepted.
title: "Trustworthy Agentic O-RAN Security: Reproducible Proof of Concept"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/joy-dutta/Trustworthy-Agentic-O-RAN-Security"
url: "https://github.com/joy-dutta/Trustworthy-Agentic-O-RAN-Security"
authors:
  - family-names: Dutta
    given-names: Joy
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - O-RAN
  - policy verification
  - security automation
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  A deterministic reference implementation and evidence package for selected
  trust-boundary and operational-feedback services, with dataset-grounded
  policy evaluation, measured processing costs, isolated packet experiments
  and a separate model-assisted policy-consistency review.
